            <lg xml:id="m-1319d95c-0a36-42f2-b0d2-585ec09c4b6f">
              <l xml:id="m-fbc99529-ed40-4855-a600-24883acb9222" facs="#m-a44d6f5c-0892-4ffc-b08c-bcf725d9e1a0" label="ambiguous">1320</l><l xml:id="m-f6747c32-d8f0-4161-9828-8710176d94ba" facs="#m-82df882f-1987-44e9-8716-b640945dbe89" label="ambiguous">December 8.</l><l xml:id="m-3d8f2948-cd06-4616-b78d-b675fdfb19c3" facs="#m-b4d4cc0d-0911-4461-b2a4-c405dd8bcd91" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-0c40a720-3c27-4745-b245-5669cffa6e32" facs="#m-a3dbaa12-042d-41cd-8911-44ab98b57797" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Tráhe nos. 1321.</l><l xml:id="m-60cd576f-3e0c-4095-8bb9-7dff3986b9e2" facs="#m-a933ac98-4572-47e4-99eb-9ea97a50d281" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-0996b072-0e8a-4bc9-9c50-df900b8461b1" facs="#m-25ffb743-c203-40b0-be13-97094ac4e1b4" label="ambiguous">Apoc. 12.</l><l xml:id="m-62687694-baf4-4bf8-a363-519ce630ce82" facs="#m-8cc0971c-1b9f-4d51-92c8-311e1a9f9ed1" label="lyrics-like">YIgnum magnum appáruit in cae-] luna sub pédibus ejus, * et in cápite</l><l xml:id="m-b2be5a74-ec2d-4213-bb0b-c3d2005fe603" facs="#m-732cda07-0381-46d9-8bbc-35b82dc9617f" label="lyrics-like">:t Múlier amicta sole, et lejus coróna stellárum duódecim.</l><l xml:id="m-57e4b27e-26e8-4a09-8fed-0827d7a00993" facs="#m-65407515-c46d-45c1-b503-9686db687788" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-c6efa315-c81d-4363-a532-1b7860ac4162" facs="#m-58dd0fe5-505b-4e78-863b-445826fbefd0" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-2c64f78c-3409-4896-b7e7-70d0c663398e" facs="#m-0c2a64f7-3b2a-44ec-9af9-8c6496ab9131" label="lyrics-like">X-altábo te Dómine, “Quóni-am sus-cepísti me.</l><l xml:id="m-6330fa3d-56ab-423a-a918-554b968843a2" facs="#m-c97573cc-95a9-442a-b1af-7d1974f62c21" label="lyrics-like">V. Nec de lectásti inimícos mé-os super me. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-d54fe6bf-384e-49e7-94c9-e67e4cefa3d2" facs="#m-5f1b9690-227a-46bf-84f3-74fde2bfc3b1" label="lyrics-like">V. Immaculáta Concéptio túa, Déi Génitrix Virgo.</l><l xml:id="m-13293e0b-80cc-455a-a716-ac5f65968821" facs="#m-ca496ce6-4fb9-463b-8187-4c06787d81b9" label="lyrics-like">R. Gáudium annuntiávit univérso múndo.</l><l xml:id="m-cc2cb179-47e4-4ffc-8cf9-49a8cec2ab78" facs="#m-645e4ce4-9720-4806-a942-4da2b4dc0362" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-cdf28fd4-c815-4740-9cfb-f6a8c7dad1c2" facs="#m-6bca33f2-baf0-456a-8e82-e3ca03ba2d55" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Dixit Dóminus. I. ga. p. 128. — 2. Laudáte púeri. 8. G.</l><l xml:id="m-e6a439de-5d8f-412e-810b-599e72a582ce" facs="#m-eb9d77af-2df2-49d2-a257-eb81b7e07b15" label="lyrics-like">p. 152. — 3. Laetátus sum. 8. c. p. 173. — 4. Nisi Dóminus. 7 a.</l><l xml:id="m-c502b44d-59de-45f6-a4b8-7d160f2a13db" facs="#m-ecb44197-253e-4acb-92ee-f45109c1ef53" label="lyrics-like">p. 176. — 5. Láuda Jerúsalem. 3. a- p. 204.</l><l xml:id="m-e82113cd-080a-46e7-9f45-205547112678" facs="#m-7ae1f7e5-39da-46bb-8e7f-89b428277f54" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-87fcd4ed-2590-49d7-9073-c0dbe56f571a" facs="#m-feaa5621-faea-414a-b141-9ee0372f263c" label="ambiguous">1.g2</l><l xml:id="m-025e9ed5-3453-4c44-96ae-14eb544c8798" facs="#m-24adfd39-79ea-4fa6-a7cc-558a3613dc64" label="lyrics-like">A Ota púlchra es Ma-rí-a, * et mácu-la o-ri-giná¬</l><l xml:id="m-62f45574-f96e-4afe-bf1b-de27237b4f38" facs="#m-27940b11-32f9-4c38-8cb8-4577adc1c4fc" label="ambiguous">2.Ant.!</l><l xml:id="m-9fb33754-09a4-4b91-816f-808bd37d0fda" facs="#m-00b2e35f-67b3-44bb-8239-b1eae540ae86" label="ambiguous">S.d</l><l xml:id="m-a4886b4e-73bb-45bd-a4b9-9bc7901a8231" facs="#m-a4d0da9f-188c-448d-86d9-8f26be9e55db" label="lyrics-like">*Estiméntum</l><l xml:id="m-d1196709-fc65-4ee6-b011-4d274321b754" facs="#m-9c9921cf-6369-40a5-8016-5973cc086b79" label="ambiguous">lis non est in te. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-3764cd92-5edf-4081-b9e0-e286c204d2ac" facs="#m-f56a9ae6-4cf2-47dd-b550-0e02bb2ceda1" label="lyrics-like">tú-um* cándidum quasi nix, et fá-ci-es tú-a sic-ut sol.</l><l xml:id="m-d14a16e4-ff6a-4ecb-8c16-eae747c102cf" facs="#m-6f984543-bc6c-4d89-ac8c-d677df56994c" label="ambiguous">8. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-17a8cb44-ac3e-4277-8f0b-b296e427ec04" facs="#m-62f03f34-5782-48f7-bb26-c75a41b29af1" label="ambiguous">8.e</l><l xml:id="m-60a9fd0f-2a1c-47c0-a3d6-8916c0ff187b" facs="#m-02dd49d7-734c-4165-8912-3fa27ba6bc02" label="ambiguous">T</l><l xml:id="m-16bf48e5-9b94-4e36-89b9-8fadcc08d63c" facs="#m-c182a240-8b27-47fb-a520-16bdce35fff7" label="lyrics-like">U gló-ri-a Je-rúsa-lem, “ tu laetí¬</l><l xml:id="m-3fbd7aee-9a21-4666-a072-1df5a014ffad" facs="#m-baa1b4b2-b1b2-4a4a-af05-3d64cd59647e" label="ambiguous">Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-64c342c9-5e0a-4dcf-93c9-b345dc97025d" facs="#m-802a0b0d-ecef-4313-8c99-d107354848cb" label="ambiguous">ti-a Isra-el,</l><l xml:id="m-33eb15d2-8e57-4fe2-8d94-ce5be045fe91" facs="#m-3d476a6f-241d-4ee5-be06-123d585b2d44" label="lyrics-like">pópu-li nóstri.</l><l xml:id="m-dd2a2290-347d-4ae7-8a4c-0a144124b7b7" facs="#m-dfc786bc-228b-42f3-a767-b11c4983d27e" label="lyrics-like">tu hono-ri-fi-cénti-a</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
